// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RazorsGangClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P971728426" "Razor's Old Gang"
// DetailString :
"P1711808445" "Razor's old gang were fixing to turn on you the moment you sprung Deadlock, but when they saw that Deadlock had already escaped from his cell, they saw fit to try and murder you themselves. Too bad for them, you had the same idea."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HackedComputerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3793299164" "Hacked Enclosure Shield Computer"
// DetailString :
"P627908810" "You hacked into the Enclosure Shield Computer and added your unique signature to the sensor logs. This will enable your to freely travel beyond this Enclosure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DeadlockDefeatedClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3116584532" "Deadlock is Dead"
// DetailString :
"P3243874424" "You found one prison Deadlock couldn't escape from. Hell."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ChrysalisClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2727753289" "Devouring Chrysalis"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ShieldDownClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1772748685" "The Shield Went Down"
// DetailString :
"P3029452199" "What the? The shield went down, and along with it, the rift deactivated. Nobody can get back to Primal Earth until that rift is reactivated, and that can't happen until the shield is back online. That means Cash Money can't get back to Sharkhead Isle, which means you aren't getting paid!<br><br>You'd better get that shield back online. Start by checking out the shield generator."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GeneratorDamagedClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1252809313" "Missing Components"
// DetailString :
"P1653368604" "A bucket load of slime oozes down the side of the shield generator, directing your attention to a gaping hole punched through the metal to an empty cavity where an important component once belonged. There is no question in your mind, the devoured deactivated the shield by ripping out that component, but how did they get in the Enclosure, and how did they know what to deactivate?<br><br>Those questions can wait, though, first you need to find that missing component."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DeadlockDeadClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3042140675" "Deadlock is Dead, For Good This Time"
// DetailString :
"P3478559034" "That's the second time you had to put Deadlock down. You hope for both your sake that it's the last.<br><br>It would seem that even in the grip of the devouring plague he retained some of his considerable tact and cunning. You wonder how much of a host's mind might remain, trapped in their devoured body, but then decide it is best not to dwell on it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GeneratorPartClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3689106620" "This Looks Important"
// DetailString :
"P1267976185" "Locked in a deathgrip in Deadlock's right 'hand', you notice an important looking piece of machinery. You free it and realize that it is the missing component from the shield generator.<br><br>Better go repair it, quick."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GeneratorRepairedClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P952692449" "Repaired Shield Generator"
// DetailString :
"P549318473" "You repaired the damage that Deadlock did to the shield generator. Now that the shield is back on the only thing left to do is clean up the devoured remaining inside the Enclosure. This will clear the security breach so that the computer systems will reactivate the Rift."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4115407951" "A Price Above Rubies"
// DetailString :
"P3700644833" "Deadlock is a cock."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3477384526" "Deadlock is a cock<br><br>Also, now he's dead."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL2-9_RE_PriceAboveRubies_V_StoryArc_SouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// tDetailString :
"P2614362291" "You took this padlock from Deadlock's body as a reminder of your battle with him over a Praetorian crystal worth <color deepskyblue>A Price Above Rubies.</color><br><br>Deadlock is a cock.<br><br>Also, now he's dead.<br><br>Seems even hell couldn't hold Deadlock, he came back as a devoured and let a bunch of other devoured into the Enclosure, then tried to kill you. Seems the stubborn bastard still had vengeance on his mind. Now he's dead, for good this time, really. Also you got set up fatter'n biscuits for selling that chrysalis to Cash Money, the pimpinest fence in the Rogue Isles."

